# FP-01 SKEPTIC regression: DateTime timezone offsets stop at +/-14:00
query I
SELECT fhirpath_is_valid('@2016-02-29T23:59:59.123+14:00') AND fhirpath_is_valid('@2016-02-29T23:59:59.123-14:00') AND NOT fhirpath_is_valid('@2016-02-29T23:59:59.123+14:01') AND NOT fhirpath_is_valid('@2016-02-29T23:59:59.123-14:01');
----
true

# FP-01 HISTORIAN regression: Integer literal range is 32-bit, allowing signed minimum through unary minus
